  "blocks": {
    "\"Different system prompts. One's tuned for terse code edits, the other for explaining — that's where the divergence lives, before your message even arrives.\"": "“系统提示词不同。一个针对简洁的代码修改做了优化，另一个针对解释做了优化——差异在你的消息到达之前就已经产生了。”",
    "\"Two harnesses, same model, totally different behavior on the same prompt.\"": "“两个运行框架使用同一个模型，却对同一提示词表现出完全不同的行为。”",
    "Because it's identical on every request, it forms the start of the prefix cache — which is part of why harnesses keep it fixed for a whole session rather than editing it as they go.": "由于系统提示词在每个请求中都完全相同，它构成了<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/prefix-cache\">前缀缓存</a>的开头。这也是运行框架通常在整个会话中保持它不变，而不是随过程不断修改的原因之一。",
    "Models are trained to prioritise the system prompt over user messages. So when an agent insists on a convention you never asked for, or formats output in a way you can't shake, it's usually obeying its system prompt — and your message is losing the argument. Some harnesses are customisable: they give you full access to the system prompt, so you can read what the agent is actually being told and change it.": "模型经过训练，会优先遵循系统提示词，而不是用户消息。因此，当智能体坚持某个你从未要求过的约定，或总以你无法改变的格式输出时，它通常是在服从系统提示词——而你的消息在这场冲突中处于下风。有些运行框架允许自定义：它们让你完整访问系统提示词，从而读到智能体实际接收的指令并加以修改。",
    "The instructions the harness prepends to every model provider request — the agent's standing brief: who it is, how to behave, which tools it can call, what conventions to follow. Usually stable across a session.": "系统提示词是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>添加到每次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model-provider-request\">模型提供商请求</a>前的指令，相当于<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>长期有效的任务简报：它是谁、应该如何行动、可以调用哪些<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool\">工具</a>、应遵循哪些约定。系统提示词通常在一次<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/session\">会话</a>中保持稳定。",
    "The system prompt is written by the harness vendor, not by you, and in coding harnesses it's big — often tens of thousands of tokens of behavioural rules, tool descriptions, and edge-case handling, all paid as input tokens on every turn. Your own standing instructions ride along with it: files like AGENTS.md are loaded next to the system prompt at the start of the session, so the model reads the vendor's brief and yours together before it ever sees your message.": "系统提示词由运行框架供应商编写，而不是由你编写。在编码运行框架中，它通常很大——行为规则、工具说明和边缘情况处理经常达到数万个 Token，并在每个<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/turn\">轮次</a>中作为<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/input-tokens\">输入 Token</a>计费。你自己的长期指令也会一同加载：像 AGENTS.md 这样的文件，会在会话开始时被放到系统提示词旁边，因此<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>在看到你的消息之前，就会同时读到供应商和你提供的简报。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
